Backport from later Firefox: pass -latomic as a list. try_link turns
the flags into list(flags), so the string became one argument per
character, the -latomic check could never succeed, and LIBATOMIC_LIBS
stayed empty ("do not know; assuming no").

diff --git build/moz.configure/libraries.configure build/moz.configure/libraries.configure
index 3c3c713..26ca886 100644
--- build/moz.configure/libraries.configure
+++ build/moz.configure/libraries.configure
@@ -131,7 +131,7 @@ with only_when(building_with_gnu_compatible_cc):
 
     is_libatomic_optional = check_std_atomic_requirements()
     is_libatomic_required = check_std_atomic_requirements(
-        flag="-latomic", when=~is_libatomic_optional
+        flag=["-latomic"], when=~is_libatomic_optional
     )
 
     @depends(is_libatomic_optional, is_libatomic_required)
